<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6032] The validation for the presence of a slash in the computed column fails, causing the model save to fail</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6032</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The use of the escape character `&lt;br class=&quot;atl-forced-newline&quot; /&gt;` (backslash) in the computed column causes the validation to fail, whereas the expected behavior is to save successfully.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13609013">KYLIN-6032</key>
