                            <comment id="17928312" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 19 Feb 2025 07:40:17 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause%26Design&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause &amp;amp; Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;`StringHelper#findQuoteIndexes` encounters escape characters `\` when searching for matching single-quote strings. This causes single quotes to be incorrectly identified as regular characters, leading to mismatched pairing. Add handling for escape characters `\`.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
